{"id":6121,"chapter_id":6,"scene_id":615,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"受骸者跪在地上，它的身体迸发出赤红色的闪光，从内部瓦解那无敌的铠甲。","style":3,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"受骸者","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>不——！不！！不！！！这不可能，这不可能！！！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6131002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"受骸者","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>我抓住了她的心，我给了她最想要的，明明是我赢了，为什么——！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6131003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"options":["你根本不懂她，也给不了她真正想要的"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"就算人心有阴暗的角落，有跨不过去的坎，那也不是你这种怪物能觊觎的养料。","style":2,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"禁闭者不是你的养料，他们只为自己战斗，你别想控制她！","style":2,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"你握紧手中的枷锁，遥相呼应一般，你的手心和怪物体内同时迸发炫目的红光。","style":3,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"你知道，那是卓娅在战斗，她在摧毁这腐朽黑暗的躯壳。","style":3,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"受骸者","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>不——！！！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6131008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"结界破了！现在就是攻击的机会！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6131009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"可是，卓娅还在里面，还有厄尔希——","voice":["vo_cgplot_6131010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"options":["那两个人也在战斗，和我们一起战斗"],"jump":[13],"style":6,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"动手吧！消灭这个怪物，彻底终结黑环，把我们的禁闭者夺回来！","style":2,"background":508,"log_type":1}]}